    "line_start": 56157,
    "line_end": 56157,
    "quote": "Current selected assignment (2026-11-19): filesafe.policy_degraded@2.0.0 is registered for application_or_project in Plans/event_family_registry.json, as recorded by Plans/Decision_Log.md#DL-2307. Its event history selects Application = RP-OPERATIONAL-2555D@1.0.0 (anchor_kind=terminal_transition, count in app:filesafe_policy_degraded, one dedicated bucket per Puppet Master Server under DL-2450), Project = RP-OPERATIONAL-2555D@1.0.0 (anchor_kind=terminal_transition, cardinality_scope=project, count in the Project partition). The Application bucket retains records for 2,555 days (220,752,000 seconds) from the existing terminal-transition anchor and admits at most 2,000,000 retained records. An append that would exceed the limit fails closed if no expired unheld member is eligible for compaction. Overflow neither evicts unexpired or held records nor borrows room from or refuses writes to another bucket. Exact original and checkpoint bindings retain their existing Storage assignments. Registry membership supplies no producer adoption or native-installation proof. Missing-registration refusal applies only if the exact current registration is absent.",
